{"date": "2020-05-01", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0501.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:18+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "d527bd6391e2cab83401fe4faf0bbef18951b31ea887853fd1360163866dc274", "image_bytes": 166539, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Tue, 28 Apr 2020 00:39:33 GMT", "title": "宜犒劳", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "人与海", "author": "波德菜尔", "author_roles": ["诗人"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "当他的心里装满了苦恼，我便像炉灶般冒起烟来，那里准备着餐饭，等待劳动者归来。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "CHARLES BAUDELAIRE", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author"], "image_sha256": "d527bd6391e2cab83401fe4faf0bbef18951b31ea887853fd1360163866dc274", "note": "对照原图署名区核对。"}}
{"date": "2020-05-02", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0502.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:18+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "1b54a1c92002cc40d02baec00accd715c039705345354b138653a05b2b3bf4fa", "image_bytes": 195569, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Thu, 30 Apr 2020 11:43:22 GMT", "title": "宜逃离", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "白日做梦有理", "author": "詹姆斯·瑟伯", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我想有一天，当乌云密布，天在下雨，现实的压力不堪忍受时，我会故意取下眼镜，离家去街上闲逛。我敢说我也许从此杏无音讯。我想不管自己会流落到哪里，都会过得无比开心。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "JAMES THURBER"}
{"date": "2020-05-03", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0503.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:18+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "3880f54041268b27f4e11fe4194241b885c8fe153d846e712f9cb5660482dfd6", "image_bytes": 166911, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Thu, 30 Apr 2020 11:43:23 GMT", "title": "宜希冀", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "夏洛的网", "author": "怀特", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "当你在等着什么事情发生，等着什么孵出来时，生活总是一段充实稳定的时光。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "E.B.WHITE"}
{"date": "2020-05-04", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0504.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:19+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "7a75b32c773545885a36d4f4b17046ecbb81187e3a1d99f7134df836ec8cfe15", "image_bytes": 164780, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Thu, 30 Apr 2020 11:43:25 GMT", "title": "忌不闻不问", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "快乐王子", "author": "王尔德", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "现世的担子太重了，不是一个人担得起的，人世的烦恼也太大了，不是一颗心受得了的。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "OSCAR WILDE"}
{"date": "2020-05-05", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0505.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:19+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "3e7c84a6d7e4d15c8e8b99fd32c4c0116e83cf9db9b5a507cc3576b067951e56", "image_bytes": 178150, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Thu, 30 Apr 2020 11:43:26 GMT", "title": "宜魂牵梦绕", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "清平乐⋅红笺小字", "author": "晏殊", "author_roles": ["文学家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "红笺小字，说尽平生意。鸿雁在云鱼在水，惆怅此情难寄。斜阳独倚西楼，遥山恰对帘钩。人面不知何处，绿波依旧东流。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2020-05-06", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0506.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:19+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "d51bbb857295677ae187a7725df7188c4c2e470d44a1e99e7f90ff7015e690ce", "image_bytes": 169424, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Thu, 30 Apr 2020 11:43:27 GMT", "title": "宜磨洋工", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "我们生活的故事", "author": "马克·斯特兰德", "author_roles": ["诗人"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "你站在窗边那里有一块心形的玻璃云那里，风的叹息犹如你言语中的洞穴你是外面树中的精灵", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "MARK STRAND"}
{"date": "2020-05-07", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0507.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "38f79d6823412a6090f6908e38e6ad682ee8c07db810b9345462c5bdf12e862d", "image_bytes": 166486, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 06 May 2020 11:36:06 GMT", "title": "忌同流合污", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "花街往事", "author": "路内", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 1, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "跳舞就是这样的，舞场就是人生，你可以和垃圾活在同一个世界，但不要和他们一起跳舞。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
{"date": "2020-05-08", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0508.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "88893c23069ae7896fa81235c74fa533aaf0df7e0b2e7b99665196e80a40697d", "image_bytes": 194962, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 06 May 2020 20:50:05 GMT", "title": "宜恬适", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "我是谁", "author": "博胡米尔·赫拉巴尔", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我自己同自己在心里交谈，喝着啤酒，这种感觉最惬意了。这时我完全心不在焉，别人的谈话声对我毫无影响，这就是那伟大的喧嚣中的孤寂。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "BOHUMIL HRABAL"}
{"date": "2020-05-09", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0509.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "2261c14900cea0cda11e05bb25c0f07943c68862cf91d7351270abd8140ec5ed", "image_bytes": 211952, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 06 May 2020 23:59:06 GMT", "title": "宜心领神会", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "离岸", "author": "佩内洛普·菲茲杰拉德", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我这一辈子都弄不明白，如果一个人真的有什么感悟的话，他为什么非得用语言把它表达出来呢？事实上，我总觉得—但愿你还明白我说的话—如果一个人把感受转化为语言后，那份感受就会失去些什么东西。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "PENELOPE FITZGERALD", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "2261c14900cea0cda11e05bb25c0f07943c68862cf91d7351270abd8140ec5ed", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}}
{"date": "2020-05-10", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0510.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "4bd4835b01a2be5f837dae2678459db1ef358aaef6efd1a10cc5b9a3c721e3a3", "image_bytes": 208535, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 06 May 2020 23:59:07 GMT", "title": "宜体贴", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "给一个未出生孩子的信", "author": "法拉奇", "author_roles": ["记者"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "是不是有一天，你会带着责备的心情冲着我大声哭喊：“是谁赋予你权利，让我降临到这个世界？你为什么要把我带到这个世界上来？为什么？”孩子，生活就是这样一种艰难的尝试。它是一场日益更新的战争。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "ORIANA FALLACI"}
{"date": "2020-05-11", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0511.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:21+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "73ff2269832cb64a5a64759bea5226f71f5425c33b298f8ba6f368b57677697c", "image_bytes": 144423, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 06 May 2020 23:59:08 GMT", "title": "忌撞南墙", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "聋哑时代", "author": "双雪涛", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "有时候越是聪明的脑袋越是脖子上的负担。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
