{"date": "2020-05-28", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0528.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:25+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "bf69f04f9f7a15ccde6da33267608880cb8c24e57b2b05b6e19bded2da3e9c2f", "image_bytes": 199748, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 25 May 2020 12:53:07 GMT", "title": "忌胡思乱想", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "自由", "author": "乔纳森·弗兰岑", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我想我的人生并不总是幸福的，或者说轻松的，或者说完全是我想要的。在某个时刻，我只能努力不去过多地想某些事，不然，它们会让我心碎。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "JONATHAN FRANZEN"}
