{"date": "2020-05-30", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0530.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:26+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "740f33be0cb14bbf66060f6ae0e6ed40c1d742d0f83701d1da60ff2c806bd5f2", "image_bytes": 217682, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 25 May 2020 12:53:09 GMT", "title": "忌道听途说", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "北野武的深夜物语", "author": "北野武", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "现在的人们不管是看电影还是买书，都要先上网查查排行榜和评价，甚至有人去电影院售票口买票，会先问售票员这部电影有没有让人感动的地方，或许以后的人连交个女朋友都得先上网查查评价。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "TAKESHI KITANO", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "740f33be0cb14bbf66060f6ae0e6ed40c1d742d0f83701d1da60ff2c806bd5f2", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}}
{"date": "2020-05-31", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0531.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:26+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "50e094a57e763b5037f22b19f798587e0d3893590d7a023c19c2013f86133834", "image_bytes": 200285, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 25 May 2020 12:53:10 GMT", "title": "忌耿耿于怀", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "移民", "author": "温弗里德·塞巴尔德", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "青少年时代的不幸在我内心是如此根深蒂固，致使它后来又迅速生长，开出恶之花长成罩在我头上的毒叶顶盖，给我这些年投下了那么多阴影，使这些年月变得黯淡无光。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "W.G.SEBALD"}
